{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1193542-soft-super-science","id":1193542,"title":"Soft super-science","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-09T07:19:35-08:00","id":1193542,"title":"Soft super-science","content":"Right now, the super science rules pretty much just apply to creating or modifying devices, chemicals, and creatures, but I think there's some stuff that implies that super-science isn't just for physical objects. Aeon mentioned the Bodhisattva creating a new mechanism for Chinese society, which seems like it could be a work of super-sociology, and I could definitely see talents developing techniques to do things that just don't work for the non-inspired, like martial arts breathing techniques, or foolproof plans. The last might be more in the realm of gifts or edges, but I was wondering if anyone else had thoughts along these lines.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23646-goblinsociety","name":"GoblinSociety","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-09T08:23:05-08:00","id":1193564,"title":"","content":"Hmmm... I think a lot of the \u201cfool proof plan\u201d tropes are already covered by Gifts and Dramatic Editing (I.e. player edits in the backup/reveal necessary for the unforeseen events to have been according to plan the whole time).<br /> <br /> Super martial arts tropes are indeed something i\u2019ve been thinking about wondering the degree to which they\u2019d need their own splat and mechanics to cover.<br /> <br /> Beyond that, I\u2019m having a hard time thinking of more of the Talent level \u201csuper soft science\u201d they aren\u2019t already capable of.<br /> <br /> Maybe something like Olivia Pope mastery of public narrative? The Doctor whispering \u201cdon\u2019t you think she looks tired\u201d (though a Talent should probably have to say it to more than one person).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-09T08:44:23-08:00","id":1193571,"title":"","content":"I did and ibthink it would be awesome to have rules for such mental nova creations. The idea of there being say a new government or society theory that simply works when followed eben as most baselines can't explain it is great. <br /> <br /> But I think such a thing is mostly doable by Novas on a far reach level as the other inspired are mostly at a normal human thought process level.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-11T04:27:00-07:00","id":1194205,"title":"","content":"Psychohistory (that isn't fraudulent).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/d